---
description: Cloudflare Pages Functions rules
globs: functions/**
---

- `functions/api/*.ts` run in the Cloudflare Workers runtime (Web APIs, not Node);
  own tsconfig, excluded from the Astro build. Typecheck:
  `npx tsc -p functions/tsconfig.json --noEmit`.
- Guard every integration on env presence and degrade gracefully (site must build with no keys).
- Validate + length-limit inputs; keep honeypots; reuse `functions/_utils.ts`.
- Read secrets from the `env` param, never `import.meta.env`; never hardcode keys/URLs.
- Prefer Web-standard APIs over heavy dependencies.
